{"id":"szf6jipwu648vissgjn8amaex","title":"我的价值感与IT工作","originalTitle":"Being of use to someone","summary":"作者在阅读《被讨厌的勇气》后，反思了自己在IT行业的工作经历，发现难以找到“被他人需要”的感觉，导致频繁感到烧灼感。作者意识到，未来应寻找能让自己感到“被他人需要”的工作，即使这意味着收入和自由度的减少。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://jmreiche.github.io/being-of-use-to-someone"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T08:26:56.347Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-04T08:42:29.652Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-04T08:42:29.652Z","category":null,"tags":["教程与观点"],"score":26,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"ad423614-bb1f-4372-b18f-9944e3a80240","title":"IT从业者反思工作价值感与实用性平衡"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"ad423614-bb1f-4372-b18f-9944e3a80240","title":"IT从业者反思工作价值感与实用性平衡"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"frXSYNj6hltw","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}